# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
**/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
**/coverage

# next.js
**/.next/
**/out/

# production
**/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*
!.env.example

# .claude — commit the team toolkit (agents/skills/settings.json); rules + workflows moved to method/,
# ignore personal + machine-local state
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# personal per-project preferences (Babich CLAUDE.local.md) — never committed
CLAUDE.local.md

# codegraph — machine-local semantic index (opt-in dev tool; rebuild with `pnpm codegraph:init`)
.codegraph/

# dev framework (in-repo) — throwaway thinking + gstack state
work/scratch/
.gstack/
**/_gstack
.context/

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts


# VitePress build output (docs + method + work sites)
**/.vitepress/dist/
**/.vitepress/cache/
# generated: area changelogs copied into the docs site at build (sources under code/**/CHANGELOG.md)
docs/apps/web/changelog.md
docs/packages/changelog.md
docs/modules/changelog.md

# turbo cache
.turbo/
**/.turbo/
